Information about all known security holes in git-annex, and their fixes.
Subscribe to the RSS feed to be kept up to date.

If you have discovered a security hole and wish to report it privately, see
[[contact]].

If you are aware of a security hole in git-annex that may be actively
exploited and for which there is not currently any available fix, please
see [[security/mitigation]] for some things you can do to avoid being
exploited.

